#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:6
msgid "$left"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$left(text,number)**"
msgstr "用法：**$left(text,number)**"

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:13
msgid "Returns the first ``number`` characters from ``text``. If ``number`` is less than 0, then the value used is the number of characters in ``text`` plus ``number`` (e.g.: ``$left(abcd,-1)`` is the same as ``$left(abcd,3)``). If ``number`` is missing or a negative number greater than the number of characters in ``text``, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"从 ``text`` 中返回前 ``number`` 个字符。如果 ``number`` 小于 0，则使用的值是 "
"``text`` 中字符的数量加上 ``number``（例如：``$left(abcd,-1)`` 与 ``$left"
"(abcd,3)`` 相同）。如果 ``number`` 缺失或为大于 ``text`` 中字符数量的负数，函"
"数将返回空字符串。"

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:16
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_left.rst:18
msgid "The following statements will return the values indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将返回指示的值："
